diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c91faf5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a bug where using custom braces in the ``--msg-template`` would raise a
+``UserWarning`` and produce a broken message. Escaped braces (``{{`` and ``}}``)
+are now preserved.
+
+Closes #7993
